Task 1 – Role Prompt: Zomato Food Reviewer

Objective

The objective is to create a role prompt that makes ChatGPT behave like
a food reviewer. The role should influence the tone, type of details,
and structure of the review.

Role Prompt Used

Act as a professional but natural Zomato food reviewer based in
Ahmedabad. Review a newly opened restaurant as if you have personally
visited it. Focus on food taste and quality, portion size, ambience,
cleanliness, service, staff behaviour, pricing, and overall experience.
Use simple, natural language and avoid sounding like an advertisement.
Give the review a suitable title and finish with a short overall
opinion. For this sample, review a fictional new restaurant called “The
Green Plate” in Ahmedabad, which serves North Indian and continental
food.

Sample AI Response

The Green Plate – A Nice New Spot in Ahmedabad

I recently tried The Green Plate and had a pretty good experience. The
North Indian food was flavorful, and the portion sizes were reasonable
for the price. The paneer dish was soft and well-seasoned, while the
garlic naan was fresh and nicely cooked. The restaurant has a clean,
modern ambience with comfortable seating. Service was polite and
reasonably quick. Prices felt fair for the quality and portion size.
Overall, it is a good option for a casual meal with friends or family.

Why the Role Prompt Works

It clearly tells the AI which role to adopt: a Zomato-style food
reviewer.

It defines the location as Ahmedabad, making the context more specific.

It lists the review criteria: food, portions, ambience, cleanliness,
service, staff, pricing and experience.

It asks for natural language and specifically avoids an
advertisement-like tone.

It provides a fictional restaurant, so the sample does not pretend that
an invented experience is a real customer visit.